  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark&#x2019;s Core Contribution to the International Service for Human Rights in 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a core contribution to support ISHR fulfil the goals and implement activities in the period January 2023 &#x2013; December 2025 as outlined in the multiannual ISHR Strategic Framework 2021-2025. The project focuses on improving the overall situation of human rights defenders internationally and nationally, and consequently amplifying their impact and improving the international human rights situation overall, and specifically in relation to gender equality and sexual and reproductive health and rights.</narrative>
  </description>
